cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Evidentia: reproducible retrieval for literature analysis"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/s-matysik/evidentia"
abstract: >-
  Evidentia measures and certifies the effect of vector-index choice on the
  evidence sets used in retrieval-augmented literature analysis. It provides a
  deterministic retrieval pipeline, three reproducibility metrics (Evidence Set
  Fidelity, Evidence Set Stability, Synthesis Divergence) and verifiable
  evidence certificates.
keywords:
  - systematic review
  - retrieval augmented generation
  - vector database
  - reproducibility
  - information retrieval
authors:
  - given-names: Sebastian
    family-names: Matysik
    affiliation: "University of Szczecin"
